          "role": "assistant",
          "content": "first thing is just talk to him. not in a blame way, but like \"hey i know you're scared let's figure this out together.\" get his side of what actually happened. then decide who needs to know and how much to tell them. if it's serious, maybe call a lawyer or someone who knows how to handle these things so you don't have to guess. one step at a time."
